#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/numerical_stability.md
#: 40b45d8dbbb84af49da85df85c8ea0d3
msgid ""
"Understand GWexpy numerical stability behavior, including whitening eps "
"handling, safe log plotting, NaN and Inf failure modes, and when users "
"should tune parameters."
msgstr ""
"GWexpy の数値安定性ガイドです。whiten の eps 処理、安全な対数表示、NaN / Inf の失敗モード、調整が必要な場面を整理します。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/numerical_stability.md:7
#: 2f84cdf0f5744d64894679afcace80df
msgid "Numerical Stability and Precision"
msgstr "数値的安定性と精度"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/numerical_stability.md:10
#: 53974ec9ca9c434e8062b338b4783d40
msgid ""
"**Who should read this page?** Standard analysis in `gwexpy` works out-of-"
"the-box with high stability. Refer to this detailed guide only if:"
msgstr ""
"**このページを読むべき方**: 通常の解析では `gwexpy` "
"のデフォルト設定で十分な安定性が確保されています。以下の状況に該当する場合のみ、この詳細ガイドを参照してください："

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/numerical_stability.md:12
#: fe6b96c3a8fb4dae9d6fa1095e122127
msgid ""
"You see \"holes\" or \"unusual colors\" in your plots caused by `NaN` or "
"`Inf`."
msgstr "プロット結果に `NaN` や `Inf` による「穴」や「異常な色」が現れた場合"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/numerical_stability.md:13
#: 83bc9549b22742458fd700938665acdf
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"You are working with extremely small signals (below $10^{-23}$) or huge "
"signals (above 1) simultaneously."
msgstr "非常に微小な信号（$10^{-23}$以下）や、逆に 1 を超える巨大な信号を同時に扱う場合"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/numerical_stability.md:14
#: d3b4ebdc4a42445c8f5dab249ed35142
msgid ""
"You want to deeply understand the numerical behavior of algorithms and tune "
"parameters like `eps` or `tol`."
msgstr "解析アルゴリズムの数値的な挙動を深く理解し、詳細パラメータ（`eps`, `tol`）を調整したい場合"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/numerical_stability.md:17
#: 47fd76cbaea7488b98ff6af467dd9794
msgid ""
"`gwexpy` is designed to handle data with an extremely wide dynamic range "
"without numerical breakdown."
msgstr ""
"`gwexpy` は、重力波データ解析で頻繁に扱われる極めて広いダイナミックレンジを持つデータを、数値的な破綻なく処理できるように設計されています。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/numerical_stability.md:20
#: 1ff79c3cb955429498f376c7ecd8da16
msgid "TL;DR"
msgstr "まず結論だけ知りたい方へ"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/numerical_stability.md:22
#: acd7693bfc764340a149b8e41887f7b2
msgid "For normal analysis, start by trusting the default `gwexpy` settings."
msgstr "通常の解析では、まず `gwexpy` のデフォルト設定をそのまま使ってください。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/numerical_stability.md:23
#: e633d527dcf14138919e1ee70182c22d
msgid ""
"Do not add manual offsets such as `+ 1e-20` before plotting unless you have "
"a concrete reason."
msgstr "プロット前に `+ 1e-20` のような手動オフセットを足す必要はありません。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/numerical_stability.md:24
#: b5b91f2c439842b188f3a8af7d932d0b
msgid ""
"Tune parameters only when you actually observe `NaN` / `Inf`, work with "
"extreme amplitudes, or need algorithm-level validation."
msgstr "調整が必要なのは、`NaN` / `Inf` が見える、極端に小さい信号を扱う、アルゴリズム検証をしたい場合に限られます。"

